      "mergeID": "66c4a3d1b37f8749ee36e6fb",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This error should probably list what required bindings it considered missing. (or print them to logs) The user should be able to click `OK` to ignore it for that session or `don't remind me` to not be warned about specific bindings being missing. \n\nFor example, on Vive I've opted to completely remove haptics, including the ones bound to Global -> Haptics -> Left/Right hand Haptic but I now get the missing required bindings popup. The warning is unnecessary, my binding setup is usable.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1491] Missing Required Bindings Popup UX issues",
