      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this, im having the same issue, as far as i know all my bindings are set up, infact i had to set up additional bindings to get my radial menu back, yet it only started considering bindings to be unbound after i added new bindings, but i didnt remove any bindings. \n\nid rather just ignore this popup indefinitely as i am not missing any functionality.",
