      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still experiencing this every single day on VRChat on the latest builds. My controls screen shows everything bound. \n\nI contacted support and listed my steps taken, but naturally got a nothing burger of a response \"Please review the articles below for more information about the update, its changes, and how to customize the controls.\"\n\nI have never changed my bindings, I have never unbound any VRChat control, yet I get this error every single day I play",
